{"parse": {"title": "13TH-19", "pageid": 139655, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-18\" title=\"13TH-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">13TH-19</span><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-20\" title=\"13TH-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">13TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">19</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.8A.A4.E8.BA.AB.E7.AC.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"护身符\">护身符</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 护身符</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Amulets</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>该<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>否<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>安<span class=\"color-value\"></span>排<span class=\"color-value\"></span>妥<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11319</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇门打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着的是又一扇门——它同样为攀爬高塔者开启。一切顺利得有如神助。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-3_7_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-3_7_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-3_7_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>这究竟是怎么回事？就好像有隐形人在帮我们打开这些门一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回应她的只有前路上一扇扇打开的门，以及空荡的回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卢卡斯不安地用手肘撞了撞艾米莉亚，凑到她的耳边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-532417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-532417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-532417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢卡斯：</div><div>……中央瞭望塔不会有鬼魂吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>别、别瞎说。就算真有恶鬼，也该在禁闭室里才对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>学校里哪有什么恶鬼，每年春分学校不都会请除灵师来检查吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安慰的话并没有起到作用，眼前两个不过六年级的孩子仍寒颤不止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>好吧，让我看看能不能给你们这两个胆小鬼找点护身符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔伸手到口袋里掏了掏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>收好，一人一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷硬的金属静静躺在孩子们柔软的掌心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-532510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-532510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-532510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>……你刚刚说，要给我们找护身符的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>这怎么不算呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>卢卡斯手里的这颗没有杀伤性，但爆炸后可以触发一次光学神秘术，关键时刻可以让人隐身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/HeadIconSmall-531716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/HeadIconSmall-531716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/HeadIconSmall-531716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>艾米莉亚的这颗扔出去可以引发小规模爆炸。怎么样，都是在学校里从没接触过的东西吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢卡斯：</div><div>为什么只有艾米莉亚的能爆炸？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>因为艾米莉亚更擅长做计划，对吗？如果只剩最后一次机会，我相信艾米莉亚会知道怎么做选择的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>而你——卢卡斯，你肯定一着急就会把手雷扔出去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-532413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-532413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-532413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢卡斯：</div><div>我、我才不会！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>我会在恰当的时机用它的，我保证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩轻声回复着，像是在对自己说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔的手在两个孩子的发顶轻拍了两下，领头踏上通向更上一层的台阶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>继续向上走吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_43\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_43\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阶梯盘旋向上，楼梯间相似的装潢模糊了旅者们的感官认知，将这场冒险的时间拉得极长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>上面就是顶层了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾米莉亚忧心忡忡地看向窗外。狭窄的窗户或许能抵挡入侵者，但无法阻止目光穿行于建筑内外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-532514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-532514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-532514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>小心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踉跄了两步，多亏了毕业生及时伸出的手才不至于向后栽倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢卡斯：</div><div>怎么了，艾米莉亚？你在发抖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>窗外……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_37.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_37\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_37\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坚不可摧的高墙正从顶部开始熔化。血迹、锈痕突兀地侵染了洁白的壁垒。火星从石料上飞溅而下，引燃了草地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一防线学校的一部分，已经暴露在了“暴雨”中。时代的异象无差别地扭曲了建筑。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_43\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_43\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……会没事的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>维尔汀……还有很多人一定都在努力。我们都会没事的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忐忑的心跳卡在嗓子眼，梅蕾尔用指腹触碰了一下紧锁的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>是你们在帮我吗，维尔汀，十四行诗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-531722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我不知道这是怎么做到的……但如果可以的话，请再帮我最后一次……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛回应她的许愿一般，门应声而开。门后，无光的空间恍若不可预知的黑洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-532419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢卡斯：</div><div>门……又打开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔抓紧了孩子们的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-531718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-531718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-531718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我们要找的东西，就在门的后面。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_44.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_44\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_44\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_43\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_43\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_7_bg_43.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_43.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……这是我能看到的最后一个结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>如果结已经解开，说明梅蕾尔顺利进入顶层平台了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>堆积在半路的金色丝线猛地扎进了门后的黑暗中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>她一定能把气象鸽带回图书馆的，我们也得及时赶去会合才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不过……我们暂时还没有离开此地的线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她这才发现搭档失去视力的双眼紧紧盯着另一个方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我看着的方向是哪里，十四行诗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_44.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_44\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_44\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_7_bg_44.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_44.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>是一扇门，要打开它吗，司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯，我想知道门后有什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>引路人的脚步陡然停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>怎么了，十四行诗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>门的另一边……不是学校的瞭望塔。我没认错的话，这里是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_38.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_38\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_38\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_7_bg_38.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_38.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_7_bg_38.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_38.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_7_bg_38.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_38.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>委员会大楼的走廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也就是说，基金会总部居然也被囊括在“奇迹”的迷宫中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线中出现了更多金线，但它们没有如同梅蕾尔的线那般闪耀，若有似无，如漂浮不定的命运般若隐若现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>混沌的黑暗在追逐着它们，让它们原本各行其是的流向缠绕在了一起，而黑暗也转瞬间到了眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗穿身而过，在某个瞬间掠走了喉间的空气，让大脑陷入了数秒的窒息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是……阿尔卡纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——阿尔卡纳？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗看了一眼空无一人的走廊——她仍然无法看见任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>祂出现在了学校吗？还是……出现在了基金会总部？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>祂在基金会总部的委员会大楼里——我知道援军为什么迟迟未到了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "13TH-19"}}